Fish: custom payloads in the client's play phase (P7). `handle_packet` has an opaque macro, so no
horizon-mixins hook can sit inside it, and it drops `CustomPayload` in its final `_ => {}`. The new
arm calls the bundle's `fish_bridge::net::client_play` (so this patch needs the bundle applied).

diff --git a/crates/horizon-client/src/game/remote.rs b/crates/horizon-client/src/game/remote.rs
index 7c2422b..0089d5a 100644
--- a/crates/horizon-client/src/game/remote.rs
+++ b/crates/horizon-client/src/game/remote.rs
@@ -3026,6 +3026,8 @@ impl Game<'_> {
                     self.titles.reset_times();
                 }
             }
+            // Fish: a custom payload of a mod (brand and quiet commands are handled before).
+            C::CustomPayload(p) => super::fish_bridge::net::client_play(self, &p),
             _ => {}
         }
         Ok(())
